    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `query_metric_window.py` that queries recent datapoints for a named metric over a time window using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a specific service. For this task, I will use the AWS CloudWatch service, which is a monitoring service for AWS cloud resources and applications. I will import the necessary AWS SDK (Boto3) and use it to query metrics from CloudWatch. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789889615624,
          "start": 1789889612748
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bdbc0bcc001ZS9eLYg4K6uSjZ",
